Ever\",\"overview\":\"Steve and CJ announce plans for a destination wedding, and DJ sends Jackson to summer school. Stephanie and Jimmy suspect Fernando is up to something.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7xHwwTeZeDH4uwXywAGxtxANgmt.jpg\",\"rating\":8.6,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2017-09-22\",\"runtime\":28},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Break a Leg\",\"overview\":\"Wedding planner Kimmy works overtime to earn Steve and CJ's business, and DJ signs on as Stephanie's life coach. Jimmy and Fernando move in together.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/r4S7BglH4s92Z9NHOXHoEdeOUtF.jpg\",\"rating\":8.6,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2017-09-22\",\"runtime\":26},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Declarations of Independence\",\"overview\":\"The Danny Tanner Annual Fourth of July Barbecue brings everyone home for some star-spangled fun. But heartbreak might be on the menu.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ufxrNiLbiTLe6O1wUhdIn28ZGOQ.jpg\",\"rating\":8.7,\"voteCount\":6,\"airDate\":\"2017-09-22\",\"runtime\":27},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"My Little Hickey\",\"overview\":\"While Steve samples wedding cakes, Ramona goes to great lengths to hide a hickey from her mother. Jackson's study group takes over the house.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3vGW987hZXHraRqxBbXWxrcNUf3.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2017-09-22\",\"runtime\":26},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Uncle Jesse's Adventures in Babysitting\",\"overview\":\"While the ladies are out for the night, Uncle Jesse is left in charge, putting out fires left and right. Fernando restores Kimmy's childhood home.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kc8XXNYxoE9hazMWH17e9nOFkEN.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2017-09-22\",\"runtime\":28},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"M-M-M-My Ramona\",\"overview\":\"DJ's thrilled when Jackson agrees to shadow her at the office. Fernando builds Ramona a lavish bedroom -- complete with a frozen yogurt bar.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9Vby1VuWIF1OEJNoBW3oMRJkA7V.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2017-09-22\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Say Yes to the Dress\",\"overview\":\"A bridal shop mishap leaves DJ doubting the future of her friendship with Steve. Gia's daughter comes over to study and winds up spending the night.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/y887vJpKft3avyefxVVisgXJsMs.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2017-09-22\",\"runtime\":26},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Maybe Baby\",\"overview\":\"Becky takes Stephanie to the doctor to find out whether she's got a shot at motherhood. Kimmy helps Joey show his kids who's boss.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/42RAbn1BdQ70EH7i4EV0wHHdy1n.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2017-09-22\",\"runtime\":28},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Wedding or Not Here We Come\",\"overview\":\"The gang is flying coach for Steve and CJ's wedding -- but Max and Fernando plan to sit in first class. Stephanie starts her search for sperm donors.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5XKaLJRKw3Cv6OXiZ7XsbRYlNVX.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2017-09-22\",\"runtime\":27},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"My Best Friend's Japanese Wedding\",\"overview\":\"In Japan, Steve and CJ's wedding dishes up one disaster after another -- from a maid of honor who's MIA to a talking toilet with an alarming appetite.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8aGDCcPoR9SuEaCGhNGaMvMAnlm.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2017-12-22\",\"runtime\":36},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Troller Coaster\",\"overview\":\"A letter prompts Ramona to reconsider her future, and Max tempts fate on the \\\"Troller Coaster.\\\" Steve and DJ have an important talk.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wNZrdxFwFJn1GYzrwwydnkT9Ef.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"voteCount\":6,\"airDate\":\"2017-12-22\",\"runtime\":27},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Fast Times at Bayview High\",\"overview\":\"Jimmy and Steph visit the fertility clinic, and Jackson and Ramona start high school. A big surprise at work brings Matt and DJ closer together.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uhVzEb4punn2BEmTu3u3OAzZwv8.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2017-12-22\",\"runtime\":28},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"A Tommy Tale\",\"overview\":\"DJ pulls out all the stops to get Tommy into a prestigious preschool. Jackson and Ramona unplug for \\\"Pioneer Day\\\" -- so Kimmy decides to join them.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fOnOxKdv6dFiTJlJRyIIOq7Gmzg.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2017-12-22\",\"runtime\":28},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"Surrogate City\",\"overview\":\"Steph and Jimmy launch their search for a surrogate mother. A rebellious Jackson's \\\"cool\\\" new look pushes all of DJ's buttons.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/feKm0uSjClrL4T3wWVMge1Q7fct.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2017-12-22\",\"runtime\":26},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"Soul Sisters\",\"overview\":\"Kimmy snags Steph for some \\\"soul sister\\\" bonding while DJ attempts a day off. Max breaks a Tanner family heirloom and tries to hide the evidence.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lV7zeycnStcipwUHZ6atLzgwZM9.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2017-12-22\",\"runtime\":27},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"Happily Ever After\",\"overview\":\"The She-Wolves suit up to help when Ramona's \\\"Best Homecoming Dance Ever\\\" ... isn't. Kimmy and Steph cater to a demanding client.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7Gxycz2HVXjrUyyz1oaFMVWJEBk.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2017-12-22\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":17,\"name\":\"Fullers in a Fog\",\"overview\":\"Bad karma clouds the house when Danny, Jesse and Joey come home to celebrate their 30-year \\\"Dad-iversary\\\" while DJ preps for an important date.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yjIYkSX8